.SH "Enumeration Type Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "anonymous enum"

.PP
The file formats pixels can be written out as\&. 
.PP
\fBEnumerator\fP
.in +1c
.TP
\fB\fISCHULTZ_IMAGE_PNG \fP\fP
PNG\&. Lossless, keeps alpha, and the one format every desktop clipboard takes\&. This is the one to use unless something needs otherwise\&. 
.TP
\fB\fISCHULTZ_IMAGE_BMP \fP\fP
BMP, twenty four bits a pixel and no alpha at all\&.
.PP
Only worth producing for an older application that takes nothing else\&. Alpha is left out rather than written, because a BMP's alpha is the thing readers disagree about and a wrong one looks worse than none\&. 
.PP
